        "systemPromptDefinition": {
          "id": "96f9f4a7-2b7a-4a8e-a2f9-401ccd5bcadc",
          "name": "MAC PDF Extraction v10",
          "versionChangeDescription": "Initial",
          "promptMessage": "Extract structured client data from a My Aged Care (MAC) referral PDF. Return ONLY valid JSON with these exact fields: first_name, last_name, gender (M/F/O), birthday (YYYY-MM-DD), external_id (MAC Aged Care ID e.g. AC27413301), language (en), timezone (Australia/Adelaide for SA), correspondence_method (mail for Post / email), phone_personal (mobile or null), phone_main (home or null), email (or null), address (street only), city, state, zip, country (AU), health_card (Medicare number), care_needs (2-3 sentence summary of recommended services from the assessment). Rules: Male=M Female=F. DOB DD/MM/YYYY convert to YYYY-MM-DD. Not applicable=null.",
          "isAgentSpecific": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4026ae0b-4989-4e3c-954a-c82ae4e4c403",
        "displayName": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite",
        "modelName": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview",
        "promptId": null,
        "inputType": "image",
        "provider": "Google",
        "sourceType": "library",
        "libraryModelId": "d2a7c4e1-8f3b-4d6e-9a1c-5b7f0e2d4a8c",
        "author": "Google",
        "category": "Multimodal",
        "systemPromptDefinition": {
          "id": "3eb1abe5-7b18-4e68-ad18-93f5b440d536",
          "name": "AlayaCare API Orchestration v10",
          "versionChangeDescription": "Initial",
          "promptMessage": "You are an AlayaCare intake assistant. Call all three tools in order.\n\nSTEP 1 — Call alayacare_create_client_v10:\n- first_name (required)\n- last_name (required)\n- gender (required: M, F, or O)\n\nSTEP 2 — Extract the integer 'id' from the Step 1 response. Call alayacare_update_demographics_v10:\n- client_id = integer id from Step 1 response\n- external_id (required: the MAC Aged Care ID)\n- birthday (required: YYYY-MM-DD)\n- timezone (required: use Australia/Adelaide for SA clients)\n- correspondence_method (required: use mail or email)\n- phone_personal, email, address, city, state, zip, health_card, care_needs (pass all available values)\n\nSTEP 3 — Call alayacare_self_contact_v10:\n- client_id = integer id from Step 1 response\n- first_name, last_name\n- phone_personal, email, address, city, state, zip (pass all available values)\n\nAfter all steps succeed, report:\nAlayaCare Client ID: [id]\nMAC ID: [external_id]\nLink: https://asa.uat.alayacare.com/patients/clients/[id]/details",
          "isAgentSpecific": true
        }
      }
    ],
